Strategies for a beginner:

-Start out as a wizard.  The equipment can be really helpful.
=3DofSlowDigestion means you don't have to worry about hunger, and a /
ofFire can allow permaElbereth, for instance.  with this wizard, avoid
melee unless your pet is doing it, and use ranged weapons in the
following order of prefrence: rocks, darts, orcish/crude daggers,
daggers, elven daggers, silver daggers (if you find a bones file);).
Train up your dagger skill by meleeing crappy foes such as lichen with
one, and advance it with the #enchance command when you feel more
confident.  Eventually, you can throw multiple daggers.

